{"thread":{"threadID":4530,"boardID":166,"topic":"TTT Maps","time":1497443860,"userID":2237,"username":"Gaara","lastPostTime":1497570086,"lastPoster":"Nachtfrische","replies":10,"views":321,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":8},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":67191,"threadID":4530,"userID":2237,"username":"Gaara","subject":"TTT Maps","time":1497443860,"lastEditTime":1497444840,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":8,"editorID":2237,"editor":"Gaara","likes":[{"userID":2556,"username":"kRAYZN","time":1497444040,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1497444216,"value":1},{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1497444676,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1497448050,"value":1},{"userID":2356,"username":"DerXXLMario","time":1497448411,"value":1},{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1497454742,"value":1},{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1497460668,"value":1},{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1497474880,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallo Dream-Community,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>ich habe mir heute die Mühe gemacht, paar TTT Maps zu testen und dabei habe viele Maps für den TTT Server gefunden.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>*Hinzufügen*<br>ttt_afterglow_v1<br>ttt_codewise2_v3_1<br>ttt_craftroom_csgo_v2<br>ttt_druglab_v3_2<br>ttt_haunts_sg<br>ttt_lost_temple_go_v1<br>ttt_sinkingship_sg<br>ttt_spaceship_v2<br>ttt_stadium_fix<br>ttt_subway_sgeditv2<br>ttt_terminal_sg_v1<br>ttt_ts_slayers_chinese_v2<br>ttt_vo_sg</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>*Entfernen*<br>ttt_stadium_slayers_v2 (da neue Version)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a>, <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1253-blackfire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@BlackFire</a>, <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a>, <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1954-wickedy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@wickedy</a><br>Hier der <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/dafwbiodvk4txf2/TTT%20Maps.zip?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Download</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":67192,"threadID":4530,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1497444689,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Schöne Maps, hab sie mir auch alle angeguckt.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":67193,"threadID":4530,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1497444859,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallo <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2237-gaara/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Gaara</a>,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Vielen Dank für deinen Vorschlag, allerdings ist es sehr aufwändig jede Map manuell zu suchen (je nachdem wo du sie gefunden hast)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Deswegen gab es mal einen Thread : <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/3259-wie-schlage-ich-am-besten-maps-vor/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Wie schlage ich am besten Maps vor</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Da du die Maps sicher alle noch auf deinem Rechner hast könntest du so freundlich sein und diese packen/uploaden?</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Dann werde ich sie gerne testen <span class=\"missing-media\">[;-)]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Beste Grüße,<br>wickedy</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":67194,"threadID":4530,"userID":2237,"username":"Gaara","subject":"","time":1497444984,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1954-wickedy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@wickedy</a> oben auf Download klicken. <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":67195,"threadID":4530,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1497445051,"lastEditTime":1497449858,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":1954,"editor":"wickedy","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Das Alter, die Sehschwäche... wo ist nur wieder meine Lesebrille? Diese Vergesslichkeit...</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Danke.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich würde der Aufnahme der Maps in den Pool mit folgenden Ausnahmen zustimmen:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>ttt_codewise2_v3_1 - Was diese Map Skybox/Kollision nennt ist ein Witz, ich könnte kotzen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>ttt_spaceship_v2 - es gibt keine Waffen auf der Map (deswegen wurde sie ursprünglich entfernt)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>ttt_ts_slayers_chinese_v2 - diese Waffenspawner sind Performancetechnisch ein graus, außerdem ist die map auch nicht sonderlich gut</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>PS: was sich an &quot;ttt_stadium_fix&quot; geändert haben soll weiß ich noch nicht allerdings ist es nicht schlecht eine aktuelle version drauf zu haben</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Beste Grüße,<br>wickedy</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":67196,"threadID":4530,"userID":2237,"username":"Gaara","subject":"","time":1497445092,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1497445113,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1497445784,"value":1},{"userID":2356,"username":"DerXXLMario","time":1497448371,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>wickedy</strong></cite><p>Das Alter, die Sehschwäche... wo ist nur wieder meine Lesebrille? Diese Vergesslichkeit...<br></p></blockquote><p>Man hilft gerne alte Menschen. <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":67197,"threadID":4530,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1497445109,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","time":1497454609,"value":1},{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1497460634,"value":1},{"userID":2576,"username":"TimeShot","time":1497467440,"value":1},{"userID":2237,"username":"Gaara","time":1497559317,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Gaara</strong></cite><p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1954-wickedy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@wickedy</a> oben auf Download klicken. <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span><br></p></blockquote><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich werde mir die Maps in den kommenden Tagen anschauen und hinzufügen, danke <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":67199,"threadID":4530,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1497447610,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wenn mein ftp-access wieder geht fang ich heute die tests an</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":67200,"threadID":4530,"userID":2237,"username":"Gaara","subject":"","time":1497450753,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>wickedy</strong></cite><p>PS: was sich an &quot;ttt_stadium_fix&quot; geändert haben soll weiß ich noch nicht allerdings ist es nicht schlecht eine aktuelle version drauf zu haben<br></p></blockquote><p>Schilder bei den Theken</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":67202,"threadID":4530,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1497454069,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Sorry, mir wurden scheinbar die Rechte aufm Testserver eingeschränkt, kann nichts hochladen. Dann muss sich wohl <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a> selbst drum kümmern <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙁</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":67326,"threadID":4530,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1497570086,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Erledigt  <span class=\"missing-media\">[right*]</span> <br>Siehe: <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/4540-changelog-16-06-2017/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Changelog - 16.06.2017</a></p>","polls":[]}]}